{"unit_id":"2277533612__dsh-zhixiaohang-guard#card-zh","repo":"2277533612/dsh-zhixiaohang-guard","commit":"e152dc8460f4dca7fb8e400665bbde07882b4bb2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zhixiaohang-guard 是面向 DSH 的智小航请求保护插件。它在模型流入口识别目标 provider，为请求按滑动窗口排队，并对智小航异常响应进行短提示替换。主要功能包括乱码净化、空白流重试、429 冷却时间补充和运行状态查看。适合使用智小航模型、需要稳定处理校园网访问异常的 DSH 用户。运行需要 Node.js 22.19 或 24 及以上版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:811-822","index.mjs:854-892","index.mjs:917-1029","index.mjs:1055-1099"]}
{"unit_id":"2277533612__dsh-zhixiaohang-guard#card-en","repo":"2277533612/dsh-zhixiaohang-guard","commit":"e152dc8460f4dca7fb8e400665bbde07882b4bb2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-zhixiaohang-guard is a DSH plugin that paces Zhixiaohang requests and replaces malformed gateway errors with short notices. It retries empty streams, adds retry delays from 429 responses, and provides a local status page. Requires Node.js 22.19 or 24 and later.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:811-822","index.mjs:854-892","index.mjs:917-1029","index.mjs:1055-1099"]}
